      "writtenOn": "2024-10-31T13:49:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought this too, but we currently don\u0027t have APIs that give you a way to do this, AFAICT. Just calling `SetBlock()` on every instruction and moving the first instruction isn\u0027t enough, as there\u0027s other state tracking in block that needs to be updated (namely `instruction_count_`).\n\nWe could potentially add a `MoveBlockInstructions(Block*)` helper to do this in one go while hiding the ugly details.",
